## Requirements

* macOS with Xcode 15+ (`xcodebuild -version`)
* No `pod install` / `swift package resolve` needed -- no third party dependencies

## Build

```sh
make build          # xcodebuild for the iOS Simulator
make test           # run the XCTest target
make run            # build, boot a simulator and launch
make simulators     # list available simulators
make clean
```

Or open `{{ class_name }}.xcodeproj` in Xcode and press Run.

MakeMaker can drive the build too:

```sh
makemaker build .
makemaker run .
```

