## Notes

The `.xcodeproj` is generated, including a **shared scheme**, so command line
builds work without opening Xcode first. Simulator builds need no signing; for
a device build regenerate with your team id:

```sh
makemaker new "{{ project_name }}" --target ios --set team_id=XXXXXXXXXX --force
```

`Greeter.swift` holds logic with no UIKit/SwiftUI imports, which is what makes
the test target fast and stable.
